{"id": 37, "ok": true, "cmd": "find", "ucas": "find (x: u8)*9 2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "find", "points": 256, "sampled": false, "type": "u8", "model": "gt1030", "peephole": [], "dot_products": {"model": "gt1030", "available": true, "cost_before": 3, "cost": 2, "expr": "u8(udot4x8(x, 0x12))", "relies_on": "udot4x8 (4 x 8-bit lanes, unsigned): lane 0: x * 18\nx in 0..255 (proved range)\nudot4x8's sum is in 0..4590: it does not wrap", "proof": "exhaustive"}, "implementations": [{"cost": 3, "expr": "18x", "why": "affine fit", "verified": true, "exhaustive": true, "proof": "exhaustive"}, {"cost": 3, "expr": "x + (x + (x << 4))", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": true, "proof": "exhaustive"}, {"cost": 4, "expr": "9(x + x)", "why": "affine fit", "verified": true, "exhaustive": true, "proof": "exhaustive"}, {"cost": 4, "expr": "2(x + (x << 3))", "why": "affine fit", "verified": true, "exhaustive": true, "proof": "exhaustive"}, {"cost": 5, "expr": "6(x + (x + x))", "why": "affine fit", "verified": true, "exhaustive": true, "proof": "exhaustive"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "find 18x: 256 points, computing in u8, costs from gt1030\n  dot products under gt1030 (sums of products laid into lanes; cost 3 as written):\n  cost 2   u8(udot4x8(x, 0x12))\n           udot4x8 (4 x 8-bit lanes, unsigned): lane 0: x * 18\n           x in 0..255 (proved range)\n           udot4x8's sum is in 0..4590: it does not wrap\n           exhaustive\n  cost 3   18x                                      affine fit\n  cost 3   x + (x + (x << 4))                       exact\n  cost 4   9(x + x)                                 affine fit\n  cost 4   2(x + (x << 3))                          affine fit\n  cost 5   6(x + (x + x))                           affine fit\n  [searched every term up to cost 4: 65536 distinct columns, bank full; 'more' continues]\n"}
